\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_0ff2ec.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F13.40.54ea79\">13.40.54ea79</a><br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 01, 2024<br/>Summer Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20240604125249&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quara_Looter_e776be.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a quara looter.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Krrrck!</li><li>Tchky!</li><li>&lt;splatter&gt;</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\"><blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>Quara Looters occupy the lowest rung of Quara society, seen as impure and tainted by their own kind, shunned and reviled, forced to eke out a desperate existence in small, roving bands or by allying themselves with less discerning Quara.\nTheir tragic fate often leads them to serve as expendable shock troops for their Plunderer overlords, who treat them with only a modicum of respect. Quara Looters are a pitiable breed, forever caught in a web of prejudice and exploitation, yet they persevere, driven by the faint hope of finding a better life amidst the darkness. They vent their frustration and pain in fits of violence and senseless cruelty. While bowing only to strength and violence, they will harrass and exploit any creature they consider more weak than themselves.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>Quara Looter casts a chain damage to players and its damage is calculated based on how many players it hits. The more players it hits, the more damage it will deal. Because of that it is considered the most dangerous quara in Podzilla as it can deal unexpected high damage to those running in the area as a group.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Quara_Looter_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Quara_Looter_Artwork_282a36.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Quara Looter Artwork.jpg (460 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\">Unknown.</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9500\" title=\"Death\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Death <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Cursed Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_Big_de8a1f.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:82.6087%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 17.3913%); display:inline-block;\">95%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9000\" title=\"Holy\"><div class=\"creature-resista